<title>USA: National Media stake held by Joseph Harrosh.</title>
<headline>National Media stake held by Joseph Harrosh.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fremont, Calif., investor Joseph Harrosh said Friday he holds a 5.57 percent stake or 1,391,600 shares in National Media Corp, a Philadelphia-based producer of infomercials.</p>
<p>In a filing with the U.S. Securities and Exchange Commission, Harrosh said he acquired the shares between Feb. 24 and Aug. 6. He most recently purchase was 242,500 shares on August 6 at $6.80 each.</p>
<p>Harrosh said he holds the shares for investment &quot;because the shares appear to be substantially undervalued.&quot;</p>
</text>
